  "prefLabel": "He-P 2707.06 Revocation of Licenses",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-03-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2707.06 Revocation of Licenses.\n\n(a) The department shall revoke a license in accordance with the procedures set forth in RSA 541-A:30, II, and RSA 184:77.\n\n(b) If a license has been revoked, the bulk milk hauler shall cease operation, pursuant to RSA 184:76-a, immediately.\n\nSource. #12631, INTERIM, eff 9-28-18, EXPIRES: 3-27-19; ss by #12743, eff 3-20-19; ss by #13175, eff 3-2-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2700.html"
}
